  description: 'Neither player can target "Exosister" monsters you control with effects
    of monsters that were Special Summoned from the GY. You can only use each of
    the following effects of "Exosister Carpedivem" once per turn. If you Xyz Summon
    an "Exosister" monster: You can declare 1 card name; negate the activated effects
    and effects on the field of cards with that original name, until the end of this
    turn. When an attack is declared involving your "Exosister" monster: You can
    target 1 Spell/Trap your opponent controls; destroy it.'
